The libraries of /usr/local/azsupport (azsupport/azsupport/files/deps.conf of azsupport/ports) in
two trees. /usr/local/azsupport/static: static, position independent libraries with
the curl of PHP (the static libcurl, only what PHP needs) and the OpenSSL of
the port: PHP built against them and the programs (curl, FFmpeg, ImageMagick)
need no library of /usr/local/lib. /usr/local/azsupport: shared libraries with the
run path /usr/local/azsupport/lib and the OpenSSL of the base system (libcurl,
libzip), for the PHP modules of pkg mode (also sqlite3, gmp, libxslt, libffi,
tidy). Versions: /usr/local/azsupport/share/doc/azsupport/VERSIONS.
